		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 9 · 5 Actions.</strong></p><p>Transform into a Huge Dragon. Gain 3 Actions, 16 flying speed, LVL Armor, 10×LVL temp HP, and:</p><ul><li><strong>Tooth &amp; Claw (1 Action).</strong> Reach: 2, <strong>Damage:</strong> 2d10+LVL. Inflicts Smoldering. Ignores armor.</li><li><strong>Immolating Breath (2 Actions).</strong> Cone: 6, <strong>Damage:</strong> KEY d10 damage on failed DEX save, half on save. Smoldering targets automatically fail.</li></ul><p>You can maintain this form for as long as the temp HP granted by this spell remains (max. 10 minutes). When it ends, you drop to 0 HP.</p>",
